#: StartupScreen_skel.cpp:153
msgid ""
"<CENTER><H1>KreateCD&nbsp;-&nbsp;CD-recording<BR>frontend&nbsp;for&nbsp;KDE</"
"H1></CENTER>"
msgstr ""
"<CENTER><H1>KreateCD&nbsp;-&nbsp;Gravador de CD<BR>Interface&nbsp;para&nbsp;KDE</"
"H1></CENTER>"

#: StartupScreen_skel.cpp:242
msgid ""
"<B>Features:</B>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Direct creation of audio CDs from MP3 or OGG/Vorbis files</li>\n"
"<li>Burn CDs <B>on the fly</B>, without large temporary files</li>\n"
"<li>Easy ISO image creation of directories (from konqy's RMB menu)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<B>Feedback:</B><BR>\n"
"As developers, we are certainly interested in what YOU want in the next "
"release of KreateCD, or what you think about it. Don't hesidate and report "
"wishes or bugs.\n"
"<P align=\"right\"><B>The KreateCD-Team</B></P>"
msgstr ""
"<B>Características:</B>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Creación directa dos CD's de audio dende MP3 ou arquivos OGG/Vorbis</li>\n"
"<li>Queimar CDs <B>sobre o vó</B>, sen grandes arquivos temporais</li>\n"
"<li>Sinxela creación de imaxes ISO de directorios (dende o menu konqy's RMB )</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<B>Reaccións:</B><BR>\n"
"Coma desenroladores,estamos interesados no que TI queres para a seguinte "
"liberación do KreateCD, ou que pensas sobre isto. Non dudes en enviar"
"os consellos e os erros.\n"
"<P align=\"right\"><B>O Equipo de KreateCD</B></P>"

